    "post_rendered": "Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e599ccf9f2f443197304e85b4f3cf601d3503aba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_1, u_2, \\dots, u_{2019}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"120\" height=\"11\" > be real numbers satisfying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/0/2d09d5e894fdd13ec466aa664f3f10da5ca8d134.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u_{1}+u_{2}+\\cdots+u_{2019}=0 \\quad \\text { and } \\quad u_{1}^{2}+u_{2}^{2}+\\cdots+u_{2019}^{2}=1.\\]\"  width=\"463\" height=\"19\" >Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/5/e358ed8aa023d718b34c9ae1aaab2fb566151049.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\min \\left(u_{1}, u_{2}, \\ldots, u_{2019}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"201\" height=\"18\" > and <span style=\"white-space:pre;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/fae8e2aead511e3cf487127eea8c431a0e5fcbe1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\max \\left(u_{1}, u_{2}, \\ldots, u_{2019}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"203\" height=\"18\" >.</span> Prove that<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/0/870973eb68893864ee8f8494efcae4c34c11d2d8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\na b \\leqslant-\\frac{1}{2019}.\n\\]\"  width=\"99\" height=\"37\" >",
    "post_canonical": "Let $u_1, u_2, \\dots, u_{2019}$ be real numbers satisfying \\[u_{1}+u_{2}+\\cdots+u_{2019}=0 \\quad \\text { and } \\quad u_{1}^{2}+u_{2}^{2}+\\cdots+u_{2019}^{2}=1.\\] Let $a=\\min \\left(u_{1}, u_{2}, \\ldots, u_{2019}\\right)$ and $b=\\max \\left(u_{1}, u_{2}, \\ldots, u_{2019}\\right)$. Prove that\n\\[\na b \\leqslant-\\frac{1}{2019}.\n\\]",
